  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Sunset Key | Inlet Beach, FL<br>Welcome to Sunset Key, a stunning Emerald Coast retreat located in a quaint, family-friendly neighborhood in Inlet Beach, just off Scenic Highway 30A and close to Rosemary Beach and 30Avenue. With both beach and lake access and the shoreline only a short walk away, this meticulously maintained home offers the perfect blend of relaxation, comfort, and coastal character.<br>Designed with an open, airy ambiance, Sunset Key is casual and quiet yet thoughtfully styled with no detail overlooked. It's an inviting space made for making memories—whether you're gathering with family, reconnecting with friends, or simply soaking in the slower pace that Inlet Beach is known for.<br>The Home<br>This spacious vacation home comfortably accommodates large groups and families with room to spread out:<br>4 Bedrooms<br>2 Primary Suites with king beds<br>1 Guest Room with two full-size beds<br>1 Bunk Room with six bunk beds—perfect for kids<br>Additional air mattresses available for extra sleeping flexibility<br>Open-concept living and dining areas ideal for group time<br>Beautiful coastal décor throughout<br>Easy access to both the beach and a nearby dune lake<br>Spend your days enjoying sugar-white sand and emerald waters, then return home to unwind in a peaceful neighborhood setting.<br>Why Inlet Beach?<br>Inlet Beach welcomes those who want to relax without a rigid schedule. Lounge by a rare coastal dune lake, bask in the sun along the Gulf, or take a leisurely stroll to nearby shops and cafés. Known for its natural beauty, wide beaches, towering dunes, and breathtaking sunsets, Inlet Beach offers the best of Florida's coastal lifestyle—laid-back, scenic, and full of charm.<br>Things to Do Nearby<br>Beach Days: Walk to beach access for swimming, sunbathing, and sunset views<br>Explore Rosemary Beach: Stroll cobblestone streets, enjoy boutique shopping, and dine at charming cafés<br>30Avenue: Easy access to shopping, dining, and live events just minutes away<br>Dune Lake Adventures: Paddleboarding and kayaking on rare coastal dune lakes<br>30A Bike Path: Cruise Scenic 30A and explore neighboring beach towns<br>Outdoor Fun: Hiking at Camp Helen State Park or fishing in the Gulf<br>Local Dining Favorites<br>Big Bad Breakfast – A must for hearty Southern breakfasts<br>Amici 30A – Italian favorites with a relaxed coastal vibe<br>Cuvee 30A – Wine-centric dining and gourmet bites<br>Donut Hole – A local legend for breakfast, lunch, or dessert<br>Shades Bar & Grill – Casual atmosphere with something for everyone<br>Pet-Friendly<br>Dogs welcome!<br>Maximum 2 dogs, 50 lbs and under<br>Non-aggressive breeds only<br>$150 pet fee with prior approval<br>Whether you're here for beach days, lake adventures, local dining, or simply to slow down and enjoy the scenery, Sunset Key is the perfect home base for experiencing everything 30A and South Walton have to offer.<br>Book Sunset Key today and start counting sunsets instead of schedules. 🌅",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Walk to Beach | Sleeps 14 | Sunset Key | Inlet Beach"
        }
      ],
