        "text": "Beautiful home with beautiful furniture.The location is quiet and you can bike to several eating spots. There were no bicycles provided like other rentals had. The house needs some small maintenance regularly instead of having things broken or not working, where the guests need to notify the management company. (Carpet stains, towel rack ready to fall off the wall, broken toilet seat and a loose faucet. The driveway looked as though someone spilled oil on it. Power washing needed). All minor issues. We would definitely recommend this property.",
